摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"NieR:Automata-inspired YoRHa industrial terminal theme for DeepSeek Harness Web.","id":"gh:1360312762","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-yorha-ui","slug":"MrmoLabs/dsh-yorha-ui","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","nier-automata","typescript","ui-theme","yorha"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"NieR:Automata-inspired YoRHa industrial terminal theme for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-yorha-ui"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A **NieR:Automata / YoRHa-inspired industrial terminal theme** for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It reshapes the DSH Web workspace, session list, composer, and overlays with sand-toned paper, charc"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"oal structural lines, and amber status markers while preserving the original interactions and light/"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"dark appearance modes."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Theme preview: a structured representation of the plugin's actual visual rules. It contains no add"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"itional animation or game assets."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Sand and charcoal palettes that follow the DSH appearance mode\n- Square geometry, hard borders, an"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"d shadow-free industrial surfaces\n- YoRHa-style workspace navigation with project headers, mechanica"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"l rails, and a reverse-video active session\n- A 32px registration grid, subtle paper texture, and se"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"gmented system rail\n- Consistent colors for the composer, menus, dialogs, code blocks, and syntax hi"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ghlighting\n- A clickable `YoRHa // TACTICAL INTERFACE 11945` repository link in the lower-right corn"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"er\n- Short, one-shot selection and expansion feedback; no continuous page animation\n- Reduced-motion"},{"id":"p8s7","text":" support, with no runtime CDN or image dependencies\n- Theme-token overrides that survive DSH theme r"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"t, with no runtime CDN or image dependencies\n- Theme-token overrides that survive DSH theme repaints"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Install from npm (stable release)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Install the current stable release from npm:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Without a globally installed `dsh` command:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Install from source"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Restart DSH Web after installation, then refresh `http://127.0.0.1:3080`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Update and uninstall"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Update the npm release:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Uninstall the plugin:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"If you previously installed a local development link, remove that link before installing `dsh-yorha-"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ou previously installed a local development link, remove that link before installing `dsh-yorha-ui`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development and verification"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Node.js 22 or later is required."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The repository pins pnpm 10 through `packageManager`; Corepack-enabled environments will select the "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"matching version automatically. `pnpm test` rebuilds the package before running the regression suite"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"atching version automatically. `pnpm test` rebuilds the package before running the regression suite."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"To inspect the selection and expansion feedback without changing a DSH installation, build the packa"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ge and run the local preview:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Open `http://127.0.0.1:4173/` and click the project and session rows. The preview loads the actual c"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"lient bundle, but its surrounding layout is illustrative."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Build output is written to `dist/`:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- `dist/index.js`: DSH host entry\n- `dist/client.js`: self-registering browser bundle with no relati"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ve runtime dependencies"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Automated releases"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The repository contains two GitHub Actions workflows:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- `CI` installs dependencies, type-checks, runs regression tests, rebuilds, and verifies the package"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" on every push to `main` and every pull request.\n- `Release` verifies that a pushed `v*` tag matches"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" the `package.json` version, runs the same checks and regression tests, creates a GitHub Release wit"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"h the `.tgz` archive attached, and publishes the same archive through npm Trusted Publishing."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Project scope"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"`src/client.ts` contains the current theme implementation. `src/prompt`, `src/tools`, `src/templates"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"`, `src/theme/tokens.css`, and `src/types.ts` are early agent-facing plugin drafts. They are retaine"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"d as design references and are not included in the current build."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Disclaimer"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"This is an unofficial community theme. It is not affiliated with Square Enix, PlatinumGames, or the "},{"id":"p39s2","text":"NieR franchise rights holders, and it contains no original game assets."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
